OL,3,GNEWSAManx designer inspired by island's
OL,4,Afolklore and history
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artist and designer from the Isle of
OL,7,FMan has used the island's history,
OL,8,Ffolklore and heritage as inspiration
OL,9,Ffor a new collection featured in
OL,10,FBritish Vogue.
OL,12,FBethany Williams, from Douglas, built
OL,13,Fher career in sustainable fashion in
OL,14,FLondon before returning to the island
OL,15,Fto recover from a chronic illness.
OL,17,FSince moving back, she has reconnected
OL,18,Fwith her roots, drawing on Manx culture
OL,19,Fand traditions in her latest designs.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,451,445,260,140,0,100
